---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact — Viso Studio" active="Contact">
  <section class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">Say hello</span><h1>Tell us what you’re dreaming up.</h1><p>Have a project in mind, a question, or just want to say hi? We’d love to hear from you.</p></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-inner split" style="align-items:start"><div class="contact-box"><h2 style="margin-top:0">Start a conversation</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.7">Give us a little context and we’ll be in touch soon.</p><form class="contact-form" action="mailto:hello@visostudio.com" method="post" enctype="text/plain"><label>Your name<input name="name" placeholder="e.g. Alex Morgan" required /></label><label>Email address<input type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required /></label><label>What can we help with?<select name="project"><option>Brand strategy</option><option>Identity &amp; design</option><option>Digital experience</option><option>Growth marketing</option><option>Something else</option></select></label><label>A little about your project<textarea name="message" placeholder="What are you working on?"></textarea></label><button class="button" type="submit">Send your message →</button></form></div><div><span class="eyebrow">We’re easy to reach</span><h2 style="font-size:30px">Good things start with hello.</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8">We’re a small, friendly team. Share what you have in mind and we’ll help you figure out what comes next.</p><div class="contact-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;margin-top:28px"><div class="contact-item"><strong>Write to us</strong><span>hello@visostudio.com</span></div><div class="contact-item"><strong>Give us a call</strong><span>+880 1234 567</span></div><div class="contact-item"><strong>Find us</strong><span>Dhaka, Bangladesh · Working everywhere</span></div></div></div></div></section>
</Layout>
